WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.380 --> 00:00:03.997
Now our visions never to vanish.

00:00:10.990 --> 00:00:12.565
A lot like your father,

00:00:12.565 --> 00:00:13.973
aren't they, Leo?

00:00:15.586 --> 00:00:16.920
Hmm. Heads up.

00:00:35.050 --> 00:00:37.200
What the fuck is that noise?

00:00:38.300 --> 00:00:39.658
And that smell?

00:00:53.280 --> 00:00:54.113
Dad?

00:00:55.896 --> 00:00:56.729
Yeah.

00:00:58.035 --> 00:00:59.202
I remember now.

00:01:13.010 --> 00:01:15.018
There you are.

00:01:15.018 --> 00:01:16.813
I've been
calling you and calling you.

00:01:16.813 --> 00:01:18.288
Oh,

00:01:18.288 --> 00:01:19.513
don't do that tone with me.

00:01:20.500 --> 00:01:24.690
You hate her because she hid it better.

00:01:52.942 --> 00:01:56.718
You're right, you know?

00:01:58.350 --> 00:01:59.350
She lies.

00:02:01.260 --> 00:02:03.352
It's here, Frederick.

00:02:03.352 --> 00:02:06.218
I'm finally, finally here.

00:02:17.610 --> 00:02:18.443
You know,

00:02:18.443 --> 00:02:19.734
I could have done this

00:02:19.734 --> 00:02:21.492
just about any way I wanted to.

00:02:28.610 --> 00:02:30.408
Your fucking smile.

00:02:33.430 --> 00:02:35.588
I don't wanna be consistently cruel.

00:02:35.588 --> 00:02:36.679
That's not me.

00:02:40.550 --> 00:02:42.183
I won't break our bond.

00:02:43.049 --> 00:02:44.365
You already cracked it.

00:02:45.332 --> 00:02:47.623
So I've just gotta put
our house back in order.

00:03:03.273 --> 00:03:08.273
(Screaming)

